ething so by and large people that  are moving here are people that are they  don't believe that stuff uh when they  come now that doesn't mean that's true  for everybody and look this is a  state with diverse opinions but look  this has always been a state that's had  liberals this has always been a state  that's have people that are left of  center  on their political views but i don't  think that's the dividing line anymore i  mean i think you can be a liberal and  not be crazy i think what we're talking  about now is things that go well beyond  just traditional i want higher taxes and  more government this is the complete  total abandonment of common sense of  balance of a reason and and almost so  hysteria on on its approach to different  issues and and um  and i do think we've avoided a lot of  that happening here that doesn't mean  it's not present at all but i i don't  see a lot of that happening i mean you  know that there aren't people that hold  those views or to talk in those ways but  but but i think what's really important  is to show the results right at the end  of the day there's a reason why  ocasio-cortez and and you know all these  other members of congress come down here  to vacation and party on new year's eve  and it and it's because you know they  may be in favor of the rules or at least  publicly in favor of the rules in their  home state but when it comes time to  actually enjoy life they're coming here  they're not going to some of these other  places and um  and so i think reminding people that and  and comparing you know us to these other  states and what they're going through uh  is one of the most important things we  can continue to do to convince people  and win this battle do you ever envy  the fact that the democrats can get away  with virtually anything like aoc can be  partying down here at clubs you know  mask lists and the whole thing while  she's locking down her own people when  clearly if you were to do anything that  the me